# Grand Bazaar (Marketplace)

## Datenbank (`market_items`)
- `creator_id` (UUID, auth user) — nicht `vendor_id`
- `guild_category`: `Arts` | `Sounds` | `Skills` | `Products` | `Healing` | `Services`
- `price_credits` (INTEGER, 100 = 1€) — nicht `price_flow`
- `price_fiat` (DECIMAL)
- View `market_items_with_vendor` aliasiert Spalten für Read-Only Queries

## Supabase Queries
```javascript
.from('market_items')
.eq('guild_category', 'Arts')  // Title Case
.eq('is_active', true)
```

## Seiten-Flow
`marketplace_3d.html` → Cinematic Dive → Guild Stall (`arts_stall.html` etc.) → Checkout

## Payments
- Production: `POST /api/create-payment-intent`
- Local dev: `dice_server.js` → `http://localhost:3000/create-payment-intent`
- Publishable Key: `window.STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` oder Test-Key aus `pricing.html`

## Vor Änderungen prüfen
- `js/modules/marketplace_core.js` (FLOW-Trades)
- `js/agents/market_agent.js` (Forge, Rotation)
- `pages/marketplace-upload.html` (korrektes Insert-Pattern)
